# Fact or Fiction: "Reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one
# pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard." Bot1 reveals exactly five (Lightning Bolt, Counterspell, Dark
# Ritual, Mox Emerald, Mox Jet) and Bot2 splits them into a first pile of two and a second of three. Bot1 keeps the first
# pile - and casts the Lightning Bolt it kept, which is the proof the card reached its hand - while the other three go to
# the graveyard. Five cards left the library: 20 - 7 opening cards - 1 draw - 5 revealed = 7.

